attle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"小菜一碟～","text_original":"余裕余裕～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"呀！","text_original":"ひゃっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"好痛！","text_original":"痛っ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"呀啊！","text_original":"きゃっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯？怎么了？","text_original":"うん？どうしたの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"大家，要好好跟上哦！","text_original":"みんな、ちゃんとついてきてね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"啊哈哈！冲呀冲呀！","text_original":"あはは、いこいこ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"大家，去下一个地方咯～！","text_original":"みんな、次行くよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_move_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"过关！Let's Go！","text_original":"クリア！レッツゴー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_move_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"谢啦！","text_original":"ありがと！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"哇……对不起……","text_original":"わっ……ごめん……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"呀！","text_original":"やっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"哎呀！","text_original":"いやっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"啊哈！","text_original":"あはっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"我们走吧！","text_original":"行こっか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"大胜利—！和往常一样呢！","text_original":"大勝利ー！いつも通りだね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"啊—！真开心！呐，再来一次好不好—？","text_original":"あー！楽しかった！ね、もっかいしないー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里好宽敞呀—！要我为你带路吗？","text_original":"ここ広いねー！私が案内してあげようか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"诶嘿嘿，难得换上了制服…不如去玩会儿吧♪","text_original":"えへへっ、せっかく制服に着替えたし…遊んじゃおっかな♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"肚子有点饿了…吃点零食吧♪","text_original":"お腹空いてきちゃった…お菓子食べちゃお♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"大家都好可爱～！好想拍合照～！","text_original":"みんな可愛い～！一緒に写真撮りた～い！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"老师你在哪~？能感觉到视线呢…去找找看吧。","text_original":"先生どこ～？視線は感じるんだけどなあ…ちょっと探してみよっかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"大家～！这边这边！","text_original":"みんな～！こっちこっち！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"老师，有想去的地方吗？我给你带路吧～","text_original":"先生、どこか行きたいところある？案内するよ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"嗯？怎么了？有事拜托我？","text_original":"うん？どうしたの？何か頼み事？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"啊哈哈，好痒～！难道老师想一起玩吗？","text_original":"あはは、くすぐったい～！もしかして先生、遊びたいの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"那我也要挠老师痒痒～！不会让你跑掉的哦～啊哈哈！","text_original":"じゃあ私も先生をこちょこちょしちゃお～！逃がさないよ～あははっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"啊！老师！这边这边—！","text_original":"あ！先生！こっちだよー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"主人大人……啊不对，老师！终于见到你啦～！","text_original":"ご主人様……じゃなくて、先生！やっと会えた～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"呀吼！老师！玩得开心吗—？","text_original":"やほ！先生！楽しんでるー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"呵呵，要玩到最后哦～！主人大人、不对、老师！","text_original":"ふふっ、最後まで遊びつくそ～！ご主人様、ううん、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"哈啊～结束了呢。真是一转眼的事呢…………当然！我玩得非～～常开心哦！","text_original":"はあ～終わっちゃった。あっという間だったね…………もちろん！すっ～～ごく、楽しかったよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"……嗯？啊！找到了！！","text_original":"……ん？あ！いた！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"……啊！果然—！","text_original":"……あっ！やっぱりー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"……哎呀哎呀？难道说！","text_original":"……あれあれ？もしかして！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"原来在这里啊！","text_original":"そこにいたんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"啊哈哈！找～到你了！","text_original":"あははっ！みーつけた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"不会让你跑掉的哦！","text_original":"見逃さないよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"太好啦！这样就能玩得更～开心了！谢谢你，老师！","text_original":"やったぁ！これでもっ～と楽しく遊べるね！ありがとう、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"出～发！","text_original":"しゅっぱーつ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"需要我帮忙吗？","text_original":"手伝えばいいの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"啊哈哈！怎么了？","text_original":"あはは！どうしたの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"主人大——啊，现在是不是该叫老师比较好？让我们一起做很～多开心的事吧！","text_original":"ご主人さ――あ、今は先生って呼んだ方がいいかな？楽しいこと、い～っぱいしようね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"啊，感觉好像变强了一点！","text_original":"あ、なんかちょっと強くなったかも！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，谢谢你！老师好温柔～！","text_original":"ふふっ、ありがと！先生優しい～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"好像力量涌上来了……？这种感觉，我有点喜欢！","text_original":"なんか力が湧いてくるような……？この感覚、好きかも！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"老师就由我来保护！要永远在一起哦！","text_original":"先生のことは私が守るからね！ずっと一緒だよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"这身制服，怎么样？主…不对，老师你说说看！","text_original":"制服、どうかな？ごしゅ…ううん、先生の感想聞きたいな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然任务很开心，但像这样和老师待在一起我也很喜欢～","text_original":"任務は楽しいけど、こうして先生といるのも好き～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师，去散散步吧？我来当小狗！诶？不行？为什么呀～？","text_original":"先生、お散歩いかない？私がワンちゃんになるから！え？ダメ？なんで～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师平时都做什么工作呢？我能帮上忙吗？我很擅长打扫哦～！","text_original":"先生はいつもどんなお仕事してるの？それって私も手伝えるやつ？お掃除なら得意だよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"哇！发现漫画！这是老师的吗？…诶，不是？可是有老师的味道呀？","text_original":"わっ！マンガはっけーん！これ先生の？…え、違う？先生の匂いがするのに？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，需要帮忙的吗？有事尽管说哦！","text_original":"先生、お手伝いできることある？なんでも言ってね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天做点什么好呢？老师你想玩什么？","text_original":"今日はなにしよっか？先生は何して遊びたい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"锵～！老师和明日奈，连在一起了！","text_original":"じゃーん！先生とアスナが、繋がっちゃいました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"如何？这样的话，无论我在哪里你都能知道了吧？","text_original":"どう？これならどこにいるのか、分かるんじゃない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"…怎么了老师？露出那样的表情。","text_original":"…どうしたの？そんな顔して。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？弄错了，吗？那系在我身上会比较好？","text_original":"ん？逆、だっけ？私に巻いたほうがよかった？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"…哎呀？…啊，啊啊！确实是呢！","text_original":"…あれ？…あ、ああ！たしかに！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"…啊哈，啊哈哈哈！好怪呀！","text_original":"…あはっ、あははは！ヘンなの！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"这下，真的…","text_original":"これ、ほんとに…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"像是在和小狗散步一样！","text_original":"ワンちゃんと散歩してるみたい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"那么…现在的老师，就是明日奈的小狗哟？","text_original":"じゃあ…今の先生は、アスナのワンちゃんだね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"明日奈的小狗，会汪汪叫吗？","text_original":"アスナのワンちゃんは、ワンワンって言えるかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵！如果能好好叫出来就给你奖励哦，好吗？","text_original":"ふふっ！ちゃんと言えたらご褒美あげるから、ね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"叫我吗—？明日奈就在这里哦！","text_original":"呼んだー？アスナはここにいるよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"果然和老师在一起很开心呢。","text_original":"やっぱ先生といると楽しいなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"什么事都可以问我哦！只要是为了老师，我随时都会赶来的！","text_original":"なんでも聞いて！先生のためならいつでも駆けつけるよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"能待在老师身边，我感到非常幸福！从今以后也要永～远在一起哦！","text_original":"先生の傍にいられて、私いますっごく幸せなんだ！これからもず～っと、一緒にいようね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"哇！我的生日，你居然记得！好厉害！好开心！我最喜欢老师了～！","text_original":"わっ！私の誕生日、覚えてたんだ！すごい！嬉しい！先生大好き～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"提问～！今天是什么日子呢～？…正确答案是～我最喜欢的，老师的生日～！鼓掌鼓掌鼓掌！啊哈哈，Happy Birthday！老师！","text_original":"問題っ！今日は何の日でしょ～？…正解は～私の大好きな、先生のお誕生日～！ぱちぱちぱち！あははっ、ハッピーバースデー！先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"街上到处都是有趣的变装的人，好热闹啊！这么开心的日子不出门也太可惜了～！来老师！一起去玩吧～！","text_original":"街中が面白い仮装の人で賑わってるね！こんな楽しい日に出かけないなんて、もったいないよ～！さあ先生！一緒にいこ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐～！老师！今年也要和我一起玩～个尽兴哦？我很期待哟，啊哈！","text_original":"明けましておめでとう～！先生！今年も私とた～くさん、遊んでくれるんでしょ？楽しみにしてるね、あはっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节快乐~！老师！有从圣诞老人那里拿到礼物吗？诶…大人拿不到礼物？那，我给您送吧！想要什么尽管说！","text_original":"メリークリスマ～ス！先生！サンタさんからプレゼントはもらった？え…大人はもらえない？じゃあ、私があげよっか？何でも言って！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"呜呜，可能稍微搞砸了……","text_original":"うう、ちょっと失敗しちゃったかも……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"好像有一点点难……","text_original":"ちょっと難しかったかも……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"我来带路吧！","text_original":"私が案内するよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯—！开始兴奋起来了！","text_original":"んー！ワクワクしてきた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"任务完成！大家辛苦啦～！","text_original":"任務完了！みんなお疲れ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0281_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"下次，也交给我吧！","text_original":"次も、私に任せて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%BF%91%20%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%88/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0281_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0281_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案。","text_original":"ブル～アーカイブ！","file":"//sta